cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or these results, please cite the paper below."
title: "QUASAR: QUantum-inspired Anomaly detection with Statistically-Audited Robustness"
abstract: >-
  A matched-scale evaluation of the amplitude-encoding (quantum fidelity)
  kernel for security anomaly detection on QKD physical-layer telemetry,
  synthetic zero-trust network flows, UNSW-NB15 and CIC-IDS2017, including
  zero-day generalization, its norm-invariance mechanism and a norm-anchored
  fix, calibration, and certified robustness.
